vices. It serves hospitals, clinics, and healthcare providers. The company was incorporated in 2003 and is headquartered in Petaling Jaya, Malaysia.","zh":"LAC Med Berhad 成立于2003年，总部位于马来西亚八打灵再也，在马来西亚和印度尼西亚从事医疗器械、诊断设备及数字健康解决方案的分销、供应与整合业务，服务对象包括医院、诊所和医疗服务提供者。","lines":["诊断设备：提供放射、超声、磁共振成像（MRI）等诊断设备，销售给医院、诊所和医疗服务提供者。","软件系统：提供数字健康解决方案及相关软件系统，服务于医疗机构的诊断用途。","维护服务：为所供应的医疗设备和诊断设备提供维护服务，客户为医院、诊所等医疗机构。"],"lines_en":["Diagnostic equipment: supplies radiographic, ultrasound, and MRI diagnostic equipment to hospitals, clinics, and healthcare providers.","Software systems: provides digital health solutions and related software systems for diagnostic purposes to healthcare institutions.","Maintenance services: offers maintenance services for the medical and diagnostic equipment it supplies to hospitals, clinics, and other healthcare providers."]}}